{"id":"tonteri_a","lemma":"tontería","pos":"noun","rank":1056,"glosses":["dumb thing","trivial thing","nonsense, gibberish, baloney, malarkey (meaningless words)"],"ipa":"/tonteˈɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tonterías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tonter%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es una tontería.","en":"That's dumb.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439204"},{"text":"Siempre nos peleamos por tonterías.","en":"We always fight over silly things.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687551"},{"text":"Me parece una tontería.","en":"That sounds stupid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448866"},{"text":"Hoy Tom no está para tonterías.","en":"Tom isn't in a good mood today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/297782"},{"text":"No hagas ninguna tontería.","en":"Don't do anything dumb.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460328"}]}